{"synopsis":"Shin Woo-jin, yang diculik saat masih kecil, dikurung di gudang dan diperbudak, secara dramatis diselamatkan dan dibawa keluar ke dunia… Shin Woo-jin mengamati ekspresi wajah dan bahasa non-verbal orang untuk menembus pikiran dan pikiran mereka. Dia mempelajari dunia melalui kemampuannya yang seperti profiler dan pengamatannya yang seperti Sherlock. Hal favorit Woo-jin adalah makanan, dan mimpinya adalah hidup normal. Tapi dunia tidak akan membiarkannya hidup normal…","alternative_title":"천재, 세상을 읽다","author":"Jeong Yong","artist":"Kim In Joong","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c5b36943-a295-4713-a3da-424f06a84b33","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_846aad8a-6101-4ad7-8589-05b46afa9066/chapter_ch_58/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"8b4a761f-236b-48e4-acae-8b7047d64013","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","d